WEBVTT

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:14.780
Hey!

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:32.090
You

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:33.520
You

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:00.560
Marunomi

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:14.820
Got it.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:35.960
The Demons have escaped.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.510
The goal is the heart of Chainsaw.

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:40.690
You don't have to.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.080
I'll split the next one in half.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:07.890
Don't hurt your heart.

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:11.990
I don't know.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:15.190
It's just that you guys are bad guys

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:17.930
I somehow understand.

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:21.270
I like bad guys

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:24.730
Even if I have to kill a lot of people...

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.130
No one complains.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:30.960
I'm going to stop.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:33.600
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:35.710
I'll be waiting for you

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.150
Sawatari here.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:32.840
At the 3rd floor of the Nishidae building,

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:34.130
I'm fighting against the Chainsaw.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:36.650
Come to me.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:50.840
Thank you for watching.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:01.160
YEEEH!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:30.710
Do you want to shoot?

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:35.160
Aim for the heart, not the arm.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:50.600
Ouch, ouch, ouch.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.940
I got hit.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:54.770
Ouch.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.260
Hey, you bastard!

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:04.280
He's your friend, isn't he?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.660
Then what's wrong?

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:09.150
Oh, try moving at least a millimeter.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.540
Your friend's face will be a big problem.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.030
You bastard.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.740
Yeah, sit down there.

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:28.220
He disappeared!

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:33.000
What?

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:44.410
Carry this guy.

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.200
Bring the car quickly.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.060
Hurry up.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:54.920
All the friends of Ken-san are...

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.700
Azutaka.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:09.230
I'm Wilhart.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.240
I'll kill the dragon.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.960
Thank you for watching!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:48.460
Thank you for watching.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.430
I'm going to take a bus and get lost among the civilians.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:09.020
Mr. Tendou.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.080
Thank you for watching.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:11.760
In Tokyo...

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:14.210
Tokui I, II, III, and IV

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:15.290
It seems they were attacked.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:17.100
Huh?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:18.640
Seriously?

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.390
Is Makima-san dead?

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:22.890
Then let's wait and see.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:24.790
Thank you for watching.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.080
Oh, my God.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:59.820
Kurose-kun, Tendo-chan...

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:01.870
There was a gunshot in the Shinkansen.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.870
There's a body, so let's clean it up.

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.100
No more eating.

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.260
There was a gunshot in Tokyo, too.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:12.230
Makima-san, that blood...

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.570
Did you get shot somewhere?

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.960
This is the place where I was shot.

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.060
I wasn't shot.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.320
It seems that the other side is quite confused.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:40.820
I haven't received any accurate information yet.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.120
Right now...

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:43.980
We're checking the damage status.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:47.220
I don't know.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.350
I'm going to support Tokyo right now.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.930
Even if I go now, I won't make it in time.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:55.270
Probably...

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.080
The enemy's goal is Denji-kun.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:09:59.360
I'll deal with it here.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.530
Kurose-kun, borrow from the Ministry of Justice about 30 criminals who have more than a life sentence.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:10.890
Tendo-chan, borrow a shrine that is as high as possible in the neighborhood.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.800
Also, please change my clothes.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:40.480
Where are you going?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:41.850
I don't know.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:43.760
Hurry up, don't talk.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:20.410
Makima-san.

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:23.690
We're almost there.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.680
Thank you, Tendo-chan.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:28.790
I'll be right there.

00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:53.810
Hurry up!

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:59.630
I'll be back in a minute.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.900
I can't fight anymore.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:06.280
You, you help too.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.540
Yes, yes, yes, yes.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.090
Bring that too.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.240
Eh? Where should I bring it?

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:23.440
Hey, hey, bring it.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:28.110
What is this?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.390
It's a tent.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.880
Hold it.

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.010
Hey, it feels weird.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:33.950
Huh?

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:36.100
What do you mean weird?

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:52.670
E-Han, let C-Han confirm Makima's death again.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.900
This is E-Han. This is E-Han.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:59.290
I haven't been able to contact C-Han for a while.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:31.800
Thank you for watching!

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:42.620
Why don't we open our eyes too?

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:46.350
Makima-san is a devil hunter directly connected to the Director-General of the Ministry of Internal Affairs.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:49.760
The Devil Hunters on the first floor...

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.840
It is unforgivable to know the devil who has made a contract.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:13:59.980
Nishi-

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:04.500
Call me Shuzo Mishima.

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:05.460
Shuzo Mishima...

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:15.940
Hurry up and bring the chains!

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:21.830
Hey! Bring it to the car!

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:25.100
Hey! Are you listening? Mishima!

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:57.080
Thank you for watching.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.680
Now I can do everything I can.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:12.580
I'm going back to Tokyo.

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.550
This kind of weak power is probably just a waste.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:24.190
We'll run away while we're still okay.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:25.460
Damn it.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.990
I thought I killed her.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:33.080
Thank you.

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:39.950
I'm sorry for trying to kill you the other day.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:52.560
I said I'm sorry!

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:19.170
I'm going to sleep!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:59.660
Thank you very much for watching until the end.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.500
If I meet you, I'll tell you that I'll quit.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:20.000
Madoka, I'm glad you're alive.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.600
How long have you been living as a Tokui?

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:25.970
Tokui 1, 2, 3, and 4.

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:27.590
Together, we'll meet in a gunfight.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.240
Other than Jenga...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:30.980
Almost all of them are dead.

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:34.060
A gun attack aimed only at the special forces.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.110
The gun devil must be involved.

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:41.120
I'm reporting from above.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.730
Due to the lack of personnel,

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.660
the special forces 1st, 2nd, and 3rd are united with the 4th.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:51.760
From now on, the special forces 4th will be under the command of Mr. Makima.

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:02.980
And this.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:03.640
What?

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:06.300
This is my dictionary.

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.420
Are you going to quit?

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:11.360
I'm starting to feel like I'm getting better at this.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.830
It's a combination of quitting or being killed.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:16.800
I see.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:28.660
Please tell me the last thing.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:33.830
Mr. Makima, how far did you expect this situation to go?

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:40.100
I can't tell the general public what's going on inside the court.

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:47.100
Madoka, thank you for everything. I'll hand this over to you.

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:09.250
Um, Ms. Magima, we're not going to the Tokuika, are we?

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:11.060
We're just here to teach you.

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:14.800
We're going back to Kyoto in a week.

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:23.200
Too bad. There are a lot of good restaurants in Tokyo.

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:59.560
Thank you for watching!

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:13.790
so hurry up, it's just one more thing I want to bet on

00:23:14.590 --> 00:23:18.030
so hurry up, it's just one more thing I want to bet on
